 squad, you must navigate an environment that seamlessly twists between gritty, low-poly PS1-era aesthetics and terrifyingly crisp, high-quality modern graphics.\n\nIn VR, the terror is up close and personal. Team up, watch each other's backs, and try to survive as the world alters around you. What looks like a harmless pixelated shadow in retro-mode might become a living nightmare when the graphics shift.\n{1693648391852156}", "short_description": "Keko is a multiplayer VR horror experience that weaponizes nostalgia and realism to keep you on edge. Trapped in a glitched reality with your squad, you must navigate an environment that seamlessly twists between gritty, low-poly PS1-era aesthetics and terrifyingly crisp, high-quality modern graphics.\n\nIn VR, the terror is up close and personal. Team up, watch each other's backs, and try to survive as the world alters around you. What looks like a harmless pixelated shadow in retro-mode might be"}]}, "developer_name": "Northern Attom Development", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/kekovr/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "pinkofr", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/kekovr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1085371904668599"}}]}, "scheduled_offers":